message: "Please cite this project when using the equilibrium construction, proof note, or Lean formalization. Please include the revision you used."
type: software
title: "Periodic equilibrium in Simon’s four-player quitting game"
authors:
  - family-names: Cowgill
    given-names: Bo
date-released: 2026-11-20
repository-code: "https://github.com/bocowgill/simon-quitting-game"
url: "https://github.com/bocowgill/simon-quitting-game"
abstract: >-
  A public research draft with a Lean-verified 1,856-period equilibrium
  for Robert Simon’s four-player quitting game. Bo Cowgill directed the
  investigation. OpenAI Codex developed the equilibrium construction and
  the Lean proofs. The result covers terminal Nash equilibrium and
  expected average payoffs uniformly over sufficiently large horizons.
